<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-1229] Conf directory content from Mahout distribution archives cannot be unpacked</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1229</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Conf directory permissions are cleared in the archive, so permissions-preserving archives (all but zip) when unpacked create conf directory but cannot unpack files into it (one gets permission denied errors).&lt;/p&gt;</description>
